  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU (2019-2023) Peace building and trauma - PMU Peace building and trauma 2018-2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PMU fredsbyggande och trauma, 2019-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med insatsen &#xe4;r att individer, grupper i civilsamh&#xe4;llet, kyrkor och institutioner bidrar till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad social samexistens genom att p&#xe5; ett fredligt s&#xe4;tt lyfta bekymmer hos gruppen.  
Det huvudsakliga syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r:
&#x2022;Fr&#xe4;mjande av fredlig samexistens, &#xf6;msesidigt f&#xf6;rtroende, och icke-v&#xe5;ldsamma medel f&#xf6;r konfliktl&#xf6;sning (detta inkluderar f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndrade attityder mot varandra genom att jobba med historiska h&#xe4;ndelser och trauman, och att f&#xe5; f&#xe4;rdigheter f&#xf6;r att l&#xf6;sa konflikter fredligt). 
&#x2022;Att fr&#xe4;mja fredliga s&#xe4;tt att uttrycka sitt missn&#xf6;je p&#xe5;, och kr&#xe4;va sina r&#xe4;ttigheter genom att uttrycka sina &#xe5;sikter p&#xe5; ett konstruktivt vis.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the intervention is for individuals, CS groups, churches and institutions to contribute to improved social co-existence and to peacefully raising the social concerns of target groups. 
The main objectives of the intervention are: 
&#x2022; Promoting peaceful co-existence and mutual trust, and promoting nonviolent means for Conflict Resolution (this includes changing the attitudes towards the other, dealing with historical grievances and trauma, and gaining the skills to resolve conflicts peacefully)
&#x2022; Promoting peaceful means for the communities to express their grievance and demand their rights through using their Voice constructively</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the intervention is stated as follows:&#xa0; &quot;Individuals, CS groups, churches and institutions contribute to improved social co-existence and to peacefully raising the social concerns of target groups.
Two objectives are put forward:&#xa0;
Objectives 1: Promoting peaceful co-existence and mutual trust, and promoting nonviolent means for Conflict Resolution (this includes changing the attitudes towards the other, dealing with historical grievances and trauma, and gaining the skills to resolve conflicts peacefully)
Objective 2: Promoting peaceful means for the communities to express their grievance and demand their rights through using their Voice constructively.</narrative>
  </description>
